        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: In Utero, in Tribute, in Entirety; In Utero; Sliver: The Best of the Box\n- People: Dave Grohl\n- Groups: Nirvana; The Vaselines\n\nFacts:\n- Nirvana released In Utero as the band’s third and final studio album.\n- In Utero, in Tribute, in Entirety was a tribute album to Nirvana’s album In Utero.\n- Nirvana’s song “Sliver” was rereleased on Sliver: The Best of the Box.\n- Sliver: The Best of the Box featured many artists, including The Vaselines, Dave Grohl, and Nirvana.",
